# Story page: nm-treasure
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Nightmare: Fool's Gold
---
The Vault glittered with apples far too perfect to be real, and some of them, I am sorry to report, were not.

{name} bit into gold and chipped a fang on a boulder. It hurt. Worse, it was embarrassing, and embarrassment lasts far longer than pain.

'Not everything that shines is yours,' said the coil. 'Only most of it.' I wrote this down as a warning to others. I have not yet found any others.
